      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that there's no \"shift\" to make. i've spent so long trying to figure myself out and i'm just... stuck. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen that never will. i'm just so tired of the performance. i honestly just wish i could find some way to make it all quiet. to just stop the noise and the emptiness at the same time.",
